            <div xml:id="d642">

                <pb facs="0580" n="574" sameAs="frus:frus1939v04/pg574"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">882.20/449: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in Liberia</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Walton</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-05-12T15:00:00-04:00">May 12, 1939—3 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>17. Your 31, May 10, 6 p.m. Please telegraph complete text of <hi
                        rendition="#italic">aide-mémoire</hi> given to you by the Liberian Secretary
                    of State on May 10. The Department would also appreciate receiving by telegraph
                    the text of the <hi rendition="#italic">aide-mémoire</hi> submitted to the
                    Liberian Government by the French Chargé d’Affaires on May 8.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
